# The HTTP listener settings (loopback bind, reverse-proxy trust) are NOT set
# here. Home Assistant stages an `http:` block from YAML as an unconfirmed trial
# that auto-reverts after five minutes, and a fresh install has no logged-in
# user to confirm it - so the listener silently falls back to 0.0.0.0. The role
# writes those settings into .storage/http instead; see http-store.json.j2.
